00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:18.570
watermelons all year.
全年买到西瓜。

327
00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:20.170
So it wasn't a problem.
所以这不是问题。

328
00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:20.610
Okay.
好吧。

329
00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:21.230
Yeah.
是啊。

