00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:48.790
I don't know what that's from.
我不知道那是怎么弄的。

340
00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.770
I don't think it was watermelons.
我不认为那是西瓜造成的。

341
00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:56.190
I don't know what to make of that other than maybe we should have splurged for new carpet.
除了觉得我们当时应该花钱换块新地毯外，我不知道该怎么解释。

