00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:01.810
in Chicago.
他说：

346
00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:07.730
I am an ER doctor and whenever I'm teaching medical students how to deliver a baby, I like
我是一名急诊科医生，每当我教医学生如何接生时，我都会

