00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:55.410
The comedian Gallagher, he used to smash watermelons.
喜剧演员加拉格尔，他以前常砸西瓜。

366
00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:57.730
And if you're on the front row, you just get splattered.
如果你坐在前排，就会被溅得满身都是。

367
00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:58.030
Yeah.
是啊。

368
00:14:58.350 --> 00:14:59.670
I think that was it.
我想就是那样。

369
00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:05.250
Aaron told me, because after he spoke with you, he came to the DM.
亚伦告诉我的，因为在他跟你谈过之后，他给我发了私信。

370
00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:06.390
Oh, he found you.
噢，他找到你了。

371
00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:07.090
We DMed.
我们互发了私信。

372
00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:07.490
Oh, good.
噢，太好了。

373
00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:12.150
He said this cold open was the first thing they shot, and it was his first time on set
他说这个开场是他们拍的第一场戏，也是他第一次来到

374
00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:14.470
