《办公室》的片场，他一直忍不住大笑出声。

375
00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:18.790
And Greg had to say to him, Aaron, this is not Everybody Loves Raymond.
格雷格不得不对他说，亚伦，这不是《人人都爱雷蒙德》。

376
00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:19.810
It's not a live show.
这不是现场直播节目。

377
00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.030
You can't laugh out loud.
你不能大笑出声。

378
00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:22.490
And he was like, oh, no.
他当时就说，噢，不。

379
00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:23.230
Yes.
是的。

380
00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:27.170
He told me that it became a thing he became very self-conscious about because he'd only
他告诉我，这让他变得非常不自在，因为他之前

381
00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:30.790
ever worked in four camera where they encourage you to laugh and laugh and laugh.
只在四机位拍摄的剧组工作过，那里鼓励你不停地大笑。

382
00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:34.170
And then he had to start suppressing the laugh and suppressing the laugh.
然后他不得不开始压抑笑声，一直压抑。

383
00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:38.950
And he said, after a long day of work and suppressing the laugh, he would go home and
他说，在漫长的一天工作和压抑笑声之后，他回家后

384
00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.430
