就会不停地打嗝。

385
00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:41.750
He told me that, too.
他也跟我说过这个。

386
00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:46.230
He had given himself some type of indigestion from holding in laughter all day.
他因为整天憋着笑，给自己憋出了某种消化不良。

387
00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:47.910
Oh.
噢。

388
00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:52.250
Well, you guys, this was very hard to watch without laughing for all of us.
好吧，伙计们，我们所有人看这段时都很难忍住不笑。

389
00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:57.590
And if you go to one minute, 11 seconds, Phyllis had to put her head down because she
如果你看到一分十一秒，菲利斯不得不低下头，因为她

390
00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:58.630
was laughing so hard.
笑得太厉害了。

391
00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.930
The shot of the bullpen.
办公区那个镜头。

392
00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:03.230
Reacting.
大家的反应。

393
00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:03.650
Yeah.
是啊。

394
00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.550
Was so funny to me.
我觉得太搞笑了。

395
00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.730
Well, there is a lot in this episode that we could not get through.
嗯，这一集里有很多内容我们还没讲完。

396
00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:09.850
Oh, man.
噢，天哪。

397
00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:11.170
The conference room.
会议室。

398
00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:11.810
We'll get there.
我们会讲到的。

399
00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:17.290
I think we should get to the party planning committee now because they have been very
我觉得我们现在应该讲讲派对筹备委员会了，因为她们一直

