00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.910
busy decorating the conference room for the shower.
忙着为迎婴派对装饰会议室。

401
00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:20.450
Yeah.
是啊。

402
00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:22.230
They have two bowls of M&Ms.
他们有两碗M&M豆。

403
00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:27.770
So I talked to Erin about this and I said, who came up with Astrid and Chevy?
所以我跟艾琳聊过这件事，我说，是谁想出“阿斯特丽德”和“雪佛兰”这两个名字的？

404
00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:30.030
And he said, Astrid was definitely Greg.
他说，“阿斯特丽德”肯定是格雷格想出来的。

405
00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.730
He thought it'd be funny to see that name on an M&M.
他觉得把那个名字印在M&M豆上会很有趣。

406
00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:37.730
And then Chevy, he couldn't remember who came up with that.
至于“雪佛兰”，他不记得是谁想出来的了。

407
00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:39.970
He said he thinks the room kind of pitched names.
他说他觉得当时大家在房间里一起提议的。

408
00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:40.850
It's funny.
挺有意思的。

409
00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:44.910
When I saw the bowls of M&Ms with the names, that was like a really popular thing.
我看到那些印着名字的M&M豆时，那东西当时真的很火。

410
00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:48.310
It might still be popular where you can get these personalized M&Ms.
可能现在依然很火，你可以定制这种个性化的M&M豆。

411
00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:49.410
Oh, I went to the website.
噢，我上过那个网站。

412
00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:50.550
It's still a whole thing.
这依然是个很流行的东西。

413
00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.430
High school graduation, anniversaries.
高中毕业、结婚纪念日什么的。

414
00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:55.310
And I did this for my parents.
我给我的父母也弄过。

415
00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:56.330
My parents' anniversary.
为了我父母的纪念日。

416
00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.210
I got M&Ms with their names on it.
我买了印有他们名字的M&M豆。

417
00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:06.490
Well, when we did the Jim and Pam wedding episode, Greg threw the cast a viewing party that was
嗯，我们拍吉姆和帕姆的婚礼那集时，格雷格给剧组办了一个观看派对，

418
00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:12.150
