就像一个小型的招待会，他准备了几碗印着“吉姆”和“帕姆”的M&M豆。

419
00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:14.150
He clearly was a big fan.
他显然是个超级粉丝。

420
00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.450
He loved that you could personalize an M&M.
他很喜欢这种能定制M&M豆的点子。

421
00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:16.830
I know.
我知道。

422
00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.490
Well, they've gotten the name wrong, though.
不过，他们把名字弄错了。

423
00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.310
The party planning committee has Ass Turd.
派对策划委员会弄成了“Ass Turd”（屁股屎）。

424
00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.570
Phyllis is like, that can't be right.
菲利斯说，这名字肯定不对。

425
00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.910
Angela's like, Michael wrote down Ass Turd.
安吉拉说，是迈克尔写下的“Ass Turd”。

426
00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:32.310
And Michael said, yeah, it's like the name of a Viking princess.
迈克尔说，没错，这就像是个维京公主的名字。

427
00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:37.330
So, of course, I had to research Ass Turd.
所以，我当然得去研究一下“Ass Turd”。

428
00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.250
I didn't research Ass Turd.
我没去研究“Ass Turd”。

429
00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.190
And he is right.
而且他是对的。

430
00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:42.550
Michael is right.
迈克尔是对的。

431
00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:48.010
According to the internet, Ass Turd has Norse, Danish, and Swedish roots.
根据互联网的说法，“Ass Turd”有挪威、丹麦和瑞典语源。

432
00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:51.710
It can mean godly strength or divine beauty.
它可以意为神圣的力量或神圣的美丽。

433
00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:57.250
And the name Ass Turd has been used by Norway's royal family for hundreds of years.
而且“Ass Turd”这个名字已经被挪威王室使用了几百年了。

434
00:17:57.910 --> 00:17:59.990
You know, Michael is annoyed by their effort.
你知道，迈克尔对他们的努力感到恼火。

435
00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:05.330
He says, Phyllis, we gave you a whole golden shower.
他说，菲利斯，我们给了你一场盛大的“黄金雨”。

436
00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:06.870
I want my golden shower.
我想要我的“黄金雨”。

437
00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:07.650
He does.
他确实这么说了。

438
00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:11.950
And then he has this talking head where he says he's going to love this baby,
然后他有一个采访镜头，说他会爱这个孩子，

439
00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:16.210
