即使不是他亲生的，就像那只喂养虎崽的狗一样。

440
00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:17.030
Right?
对吧？

441
00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.110
Bizarre, but also beautiful.
离奇，但也挺美好的。

442
00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:19.850
It happens.
这种事确实会发生。

443
00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:21.730
Jenna, I looked it up.
珍娜，我查过了。

444
00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:25.770
And there are so many stories of dogs nursing tigers.
确实有很多关于狗喂养老虎的故事。

445
00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:30.950
But the one that caught my eye was on the Today Show in August of 2008.
但最吸引我眼球的是2008年8月《今日秀》上的那则报道。

446
00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:32.970
That's when we shot this episode.
那正是我们拍摄这一集的时候。

447
00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:33.570
I know.
我知道。

448
00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:38.630
And there was a safari park in Kansas with a white tiger named Sassy.
当时堪萨斯州有个野生动物园，里面有一只叫“萨西”的白虎。

449
00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:39.370
Oh.
噢。

450
00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:43.110
Who had cubs, but she was too sassy to nurse them.
它生了幼崽，但它太“萨西”（傲慢/泼辣）了，不肯喂养它们。

451
00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:43.750
Okay.
好的。

452
00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:46.570
So a golden retriever stepped in, Isabella.
所以一只金毛寻回犬介入了，伊莎贝拉。

453
00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:49.090
Well, I would expect that from a golden retriever.
嗯，我倒觉得金毛犬做出这种事很正常。

454
00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:49.770
I really would.
真的。

455
00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:50.850
What a good dog.
真是条好狗。

456
00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:55.050
Anyway, it just cracked me up that on the Today Show, there was a whole thing about
总之，在《今日秀》上看到关于

457
00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.730
Sassy and Isabella.
萨西和伊莎贝拉的报道，真的把我逗乐了。

458
00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:58.870
And I think it ended up in our episode.
而且我觉得这事最后被放进了我们的剧集里。

459
00:18:59.190 --> 00:18:59.930
Clearly it did.
显然是的。

460
00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.430
Michael is going to bark orders at Phyllis.
迈克尔要对菲利斯发号施令了。

461
00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.190
She's doing a talking head.
她正在录制访谈片段。

462
00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:06.770
I was supposed to be glaring at her in the background.
我本该在背景里怒视她的。

463
00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:11.170
And if you go to four minutes, 11 seconds, you can see me talking to Andy.
如果你把进度条拉到4分11秒，就能看到我在和安迪说话。

464
00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:14.090
And I'm so delighted that Phyllis is messing up.
我当时很高兴看到菲利斯搞砸了。

465
00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:17.990
And then Michael walks in and kind of yells at her and says, make the party, make the party.
然后迈克尔走进来，冲她大喊大叫，说快去办派对，快去办派对。

466
00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:20.910
And then he leaves and Phyllis starts pumping the balloon.
接着他离开了，菲利斯开始给气球打气。

467
00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:25.650
Well, Steve improvised, walking back in and saying, pump it, pump it.
其实，史蒂夫即兴发挥，又走回来喊道：打气，打气。

468
00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:26.170
He did?
真的吗？

