剧本里根本没有。

483
00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.030
Oh my gosh.
天哪。

484
00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:07.770
I watched this and I feel like I have had these conversations.
我看了这段，感觉自己也经历过这种对话。

485
00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:08.370
Yes.
没错。

486
00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:09.350
A hundred percent.
百分之百。

487
00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:13.090
And I love the line when she's like, why can't you just be in art school with me?
我特别喜欢她说“你为什么就不能和我一起上艺术学校呢？”那句台词。

488
00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.370
Because she's trying so hard to tell him the story.
因为她真的很努力地想把故事讲给他听。

489
00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:21.230
And, you know, this is the beginning of this storyline with Jim and Pam, where we're going
而且，你知道，这是吉姆和帕姆这条故事线的开端，我们要

490
00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:26.610
to show that this distance has gone on for a while and maybe they're not connecting as
展示这种距离感已经持续了一段时间，也许他们不像

491
00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:28.190
easily as they used to.
过去那样容易产生共鸣了。

492
00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:30.370
You know, long distance relationships are hard.
你知道，异地恋很难。

493
00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:35.210
And particularly when the people involved in your new life, the other person doesn't
尤其是当你新生活里的人，对方

494
00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:35.430
know.
根本不认识的时候。

495
00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:37.010
And it's kind of hard to keep track.
而且很难跟上对方的节奏。

496
00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:38.190
Oh, yes.
哦，确实。

497
00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:43.210
I mean, we experience this all the time when we go on locations or I remember Lee went
我是说，我们经常遇到这种情况，比如当我们去外地拍摄时，我记得李去

498
00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:47.910
on location to shoot a movie and he was directing a film and he's trying to tell me this hilarious
外地拍电影，他在执导一部影片，他试着跟我讲一个关于道具事故的搞笑

499
00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:53.670
story about some prop mishap that happened and everyone was laughing about these prop glasses.
故事，每个人都在笑那些道具眼镜。

500
00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.650
And I'm just like, I don't know who any of these people are.
而我当时心想，我根本不知道这些人是谁。

501
00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:02.310
And what's really hard about it is that I like to be able to imagine the people or where
最难的一点在于，我喜欢能够想象出人们的样子或者他们

502
00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:02.910
they are.
所在的地方。

503
00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:07.550
And we've talked about this when we get to a new place where like, send me a video of
我们之前聊过，每当我们到了一个新地方，就会说，给我发个视频

