As Michael is preparing for Jan's arrival, he needs to tell Holly that he's going to be kind of cold to her today because he needs to protect Jan's feelings.
迈克尔在准备迎接简的到来时，他需要告诉霍莉，他今天会对她冷淡一点，因为他需要照顾简的感受。

579
00:24:30.290 --> 00:24:31.750
Jan's bloated feelings.
简那肿胀的感受。

580
00:24:31.750 --> 00:24:33.890
Yeah, because Jan is going to come in.
没错，因为简要过来了。

581
00:24:33.970 --> 00:24:36.470
She's going to be so unattractive.
她看起来会很没吸引力。

582
00:24:36.650 --> 00:24:38.270
And Holly is very attractive.
而霍莉非常有吸引力。

583
00:24:38.530 --> 00:24:40.510
And, yeah, he just wants to be sensitive.
所以，没错，他只是想体贴一点。

584
00:24:40.810 --> 00:24:42.450
So he warns her.
于是他提前警告了她。

585
00:24:42.750 --> 00:24:45.310
But then Jan arrives.
但随后简到了。

586
00:24:45.870 --> 00:24:47.150
She's not pregnant.
她并没有怀孕。

587
00:24:47.390 --> 00:24:48.890
She has a baby.
她已经生了孩子。

588
00:24:49.190 --> 00:24:50.530
And she looks amazing.
而且她看起来状态极佳。

589
00:24:50.870 --> 00:24:51.330
Yeah.
没错。

590
00:24:51.610 --> 00:24:52.890
But she's had the baby.
但她已经生完孩子了。

591
00:24:53.170 --> 00:24:57.690
We had a fan question from Brittany Y, Sarah M, and many more.
我们收到了来自布列塔尼·Y、莎拉·M以及许多其他人的粉丝提问。

592
00:24:57.850 --> 00:25:00.470
Who is the baby that played Astrid?
饰演阿斯特丽德的那个婴儿是谁？

593
00:25:00.470 --> 00:25:03.390
I will tell you, thanks to Jamesopedia.
多亏了《詹姆斯百科》，我来告诉你们。

594
00:25:04.070 --> 00:25:08.070
First of all, you know, babies are played by many babies.
首先，你们知道，婴儿角色通常由多个婴儿轮流扮演。

595
00:25:09.250 --> 00:25:10.750
Sometimes they're a set of twins.
有时是一对双胞胎。

596
00:25:10.930 --> 00:25:17.830
Like in the case of Cece, Cece was this set of twins, and it was the same twin girls all through the show.
就像西西的情况，西西是由一对双胞胎扮演的，而且整个剧集里都是那对双胞胎女孩。

597
00:25:18.010 --> 00:25:20.550
They were absolute sweethearts, and I loved them.
她们绝对是小甜心，我超爱她们。

598
00:25:20.550 --> 00:25:27.430
But sometimes, especially with a baby this little, it's like three babies, five babies, lots of babies.
但有时，特别是对于这么小的婴儿，可能需要三个、五个，甚至更多的婴儿来演。

599
00:25:27.570 --> 00:25:30.990
Oh, Philip was several different babies, and then a different toddler.
噢，菲利普就是由好几个不同的婴儿扮演的，后来又换成了不同的幼儿演员。

600
00:25:31.550 --> 00:25:31.950
Yes.
是的。

601
00:25:32.270 --> 00:25:36.170
So this is because there are rules about babies working on a set.
这是因为关于婴儿在片场工作是有相关规定的。

602
00:25:36.310 --> 00:25:38.450
They can only work for like 20 minutes.
他们每次只能工作大概20分钟。

603
00:25:38.450 --> 00:25:40.110
And I think that's a good thing.
我觉得这挺好的。

604
00:25:40.330 --> 00:25:40.730
Yes.
没错。

605
00:25:41.710 --> 00:25:46.690
Also, if you have a baby and one of them's fussy, you can swap them out for a different baby.
而且，如果你有婴儿，其中一个闹脾气了，你可以换另一个婴儿上来。

606
00:25:46.930 --> 00:25:47.890
They're all dressed the same.
他们穿的衣服都一模一样。

607
00:25:48.010 --> 00:25:50.550
You go backstage, and there's like six babies in the same outfit.
你去后台，会有六个穿着同样衣服的婴儿。

608
00:25:51.170 --> 00:25:56.510
So Astrid was played first by a set of twins and another baby.
所以阿斯特丽德最初是由一对双胞胎和另一个婴儿轮流扮演的。

609
00:25:56.750 --> 00:25:58.050
Here's the crazy thing.
最疯狂的是这个。

610
00:25:58.250 --> 00:26:01.570
The twins' names were Matthew and Joey Levinson.
那对双胞胎的名字叫马修·莱文森和乔伊·莱文森。

611
00:26:02.230 --> 00:26:02.750
Crazy.
太疯狂了。

612
00:26:03.050 --> 00:26:03.350
Right?
对吧？

613
00:26:03.350 --> 00:26:05.670
And they were playing Jan Levinson's baby.
而他们扮演的正是简·莱文森的孩子。

614
00:26:05.890 --> 00:26:06.250
Yes.
是的。

615
00:26:06.570 --> 00:26:08.810
The other baby was Harvey Green.
另一个婴儿叫哈维·格林。

616
00:26:08.990 --> 00:26:12.210
So her babies were the Levinson Green babies.
所以她的孩子就是莱文森-格林宝宝。

617
00:26:12.490 --> 00:26:12.710
Okay.
好吧。

618
00:26:13.710 --> 00:26:14.390
All right.
行吧。

619
00:26:14.530 --> 00:26:15.890
And then that was on one day.
那是一天的情况。

620
00:26:16.090 --> 00:26:20.190
The other day, we had a set of triplets playing Astrid.
另一天，我们有一组三胞胎来扮演阿斯特丽德。

621
00:26:20.490 --> 00:26:23.430
They were Chase, Chloe, and Juliet Purcell.
他们是蔡斯、克洛伊和朱丽叶·珀塞尔。

622
00:26:23.730 --> 00:26:25.670
So those are all the babies.
所以这些就是所有的婴儿了。

623
00:26:25.670 --> 00:26:26.970
We also had a fake baby.
我们还有一个假婴儿。

624
00:26:27.170 --> 00:26:28.630
We did have a fake baby.
我们确实有个假婴儿。

625
00:26:28.730 --> 00:26:28.870
Yeah.
没错。

626
00:26:29.110 --> 00:26:32.890
And it's really funny because if you look at the call sheet scene by scene,
这真的很有趣，因为如果你逐场查看通告单，

627
00:26:33.350 --> 00:26:38.230
it'll say real baby or fake baby, like what we're using in the scene.
上面会写着真婴儿还是假婴儿，标明我们在那场戏里用的是哪一个。

628
00:26:38.330 --> 00:26:39.630
And they would stagger them, right?
他们会把这些安排错开，对吧？

629
00:26:39.750 --> 00:26:41.570
Because the babies could only work for 20 minutes.
因为婴儿每次只能工作20分钟。

630
00:26:41.990 --> 00:26:45.490
So you'd have a scene with a real baby and then a scene with a fake baby.
所以你会拍一场用真婴儿的戏，然后接一场用假婴儿的戏。

631
00:26:45.690 --> 00:26:50.310
Well, Michael walks out of the kitchen, and he sees Jan with the baby.
迈克尔从厨房走出来，看到简抱着孩子。

632
00:26:50.730 --> 00:26:52.250
I can't imagine how he felt.
我无法想象他当时是什么心情。

633
00:26:52.390 --> 00:26:54.790
He'd been to all of his birthing classes with her.
他明明和她一起上过所有的产前辅导课。

634
00:26:55.350 --> 00:26:58.030
And then he was sort of left out of this big moment.
结果他却被排除在这个重要时刻之外。

635
00:26:58.710 --> 00:27:00.590
And he confronts Jan about it.
于是他去找简对质。

636
00:27:00.590 --> 00:27:03.610
This is one of my favorite couplets of dialogue from the whole episode.
这是整集中我最喜欢的对白之一。

637
00:27:04.070 --> 00:27:04.550
Okay.
好的。

638
00:27:04.790 --> 00:27:05.890
It's so rich.
内容太丰富了。

639
00:27:06.070 --> 00:27:08.030
Michael says, why didn't you call me?
迈克尔问，你为什么不叫我？

640
00:27:08.130 --> 00:27:09.030
I could have helped.
我本可以帮忙的。

641
00:27:09.370 --> 00:27:13.190
Jan said, well, the birth instructor thought it wasn't a good idea for you to be there.
简说，产前辅导老师觉得你不适合在场。

642
00:27:13.410 --> 00:27:19.290
So Michael says, oh, man, him, that guy, he had no sense of humor.
迈克尔就说，天哪，那家伙，他一点幽默感都没有。

643
00:27:19.290 --> 00:27:22.030
And I proved him wrong in so many ways.
我用各种方式证明了他错了。

644
00:27:22.450 --> 00:27:25.050
And it just made me think about these classes.
这让我不禁想到了这些课程。

645
00:27:25.050 --> 00:27:30.990
I wish we could have seen Michael trying to do comedy bits with, like, a birthing instructor.
真希望我们能看到迈克尔试图在产前辅导老师面前讲段子的样子。

646
00:27:31.490 --> 00:27:33.210
I would have loved to have seen that scene.
我真的很想看那场戏。

647
00:27:33.430 --> 00:27:36.530
I think what Jan has done to Michael is so cruel.
我觉得简对迈克尔做的事太残忍了。

648
00:27:36.570 --> 00:27:37.290
I know.
我知道。

649
00:27:37.750 --> 00:27:39.290
That she didn't call him.
她竟然没叫他。

650
00:27:39.430 --> 00:27:43.890
And also in that scene, Jan is like, Michael, you don't know what I have been through.
而且在那场戏里，简还说，迈克尔，你根本不知道我经历了什么。

651
00:27:43.890 --> 00:27:44.930
And he said, no.
他说，不。

652
00:27:45.130 --> 00:27:46.210
No, I don't.
不，我没有。

653
00:27:46.510 --> 00:27:48.710
And I love Steve's delivery on that.
我很喜欢史蒂夫在那里的演绎方式。

654
00:27:48.830 --> 00:27:49.210
I know.
我知道。

655
00:27:49.210 --> 00:27:54.050
I guess she feels bad and she lets him hold the baby, but it says the baby has to stay in the car seat.
我想她觉得过意不去，就让他抱了孩子，但她说孩子必须待在安全座椅里。

656
00:27:54.410 --> 00:28:01.550
And then Michael has this very sweet talking head where he says he loves babies and he tries to pick them up and hold one every day.
然后迈克尔有一段非常温馨的采访，他说他很喜欢婴儿，每天都试着去抱抱他们。

657
00:28:01.750 --> 00:28:03.150
It just nourishes him.
这让他感到满足。

658
00:28:03.690 --> 00:28:07.230
And then we see this really sweet montage of Michael and babies.
接着我们看到了一段迈克尔和婴儿们在一起的温馨剪辑。

659
00:28:07.430 --> 00:28:08.710
And the babies love him.
而且婴儿们都很喜欢他。

660
00:28:08.850 --> 00:28:09.670
They really do.
他们确实很喜欢。

661
00:28:10.050 --> 00:28:13.450
Well, that's because it's Steve Carell is holding the baby.
嗯，那是因为抱着孩子的是史蒂夫·卡瑞尔。

662
00:28:13.770 --> 00:28:13.850
I know.
我知道。

663
00:28:13.910 --> 00:28:18.150
I mean, not to say that they wouldn't have loved Michael, but Steve is a natural with kids.
我的意思是，并不是说他们不会喜欢迈克尔，但史蒂夫确实很有孩子缘。

664
00:28:18.330 --> 00:28:18.690
I know.
我知道。

665
00:28:19.210 --> 00:28:21.010
We had a fan question from Evan L.
我们收到了来自埃文·L.

666
00:28:21.150 --> 00:28:22.150
and Stacey M.
和斯泰西·M.的粉丝提问。

667
00:28:22.350 --> 00:28:31.190
In the scenes where Michael is holding all the babies, were those hired actors or did the crew just go out and let people line up to have their baby held by Steve Carell?
在迈克尔抱着所有婴儿的那些场景里，那些是雇来的演员，还是剧组直接让人们排队让史蒂夫·卡瑞尔抱他们的孩子？

668
00:28:32.310 --> 00:28:37.370
All of those babies were the children of our writers and our crew.
所有那些婴儿都是我们编剧和剧组人员的孩子。

669
00:28:37.710 --> 00:28:39.590
So here is a list of the babies.
所以这是一份婴儿名单。

670
00:28:39.950 --> 00:28:42.890
At nine minutes, you have baby on the street.
在九分钟时，那个是街上的婴儿。

671
00:28:43.430 --> 00:28:47.670
This is Emma Holland, daughter of our editor, Dean Holland.
这是我们剪辑师迪恩·霍兰德的女儿，艾玛·霍兰德。

672
00:28:47.670 --> 00:28:50.610
And that is also Dean's wife, Tasha.
旁边那位也是迪恩的妻子，塔莎。

673
00:28:50.930 --> 00:28:55.430
At nine minutes, nine seconds, I'm calling this one baby at the bathroom.
在九分零九秒，我把这个称为洗手间的婴儿。

674
00:28:56.330 --> 00:28:58.590
That baby is Theodore Grandy.
那个婴儿是西奥多·格兰迪。

675
00:28:58.810 --> 00:29:00.850
The woman is Sage Grandy.
那位女士是塞奇·格兰迪。

676
00:29:00.850 --> 00:29:04.070
And this is the son of our writer, Charlie Grandy.
他是我们编剧查理·格兰迪的儿子。

677
00:29:05.470 --> 00:29:09.270
At nine minutes, 15 seconds, we have double baby.
在九分十五秒，我们有两个婴儿。

678
00:29:09.750 --> 00:29:12.410
And that is our writer, Mike Schur's wife, J.J.
那是我们编剧迈克·舒尔的妻子，J.J.

679
00:29:12.590 --> 00:29:19.150
Philbin and their baby, William, along with our camera operator, Matt Soan's wife, Melissa and their baby, Devin.
菲尔宾和他们的孩子威廉，还有我们摄影师马特·索恩的妻子梅丽莎和他们的孩子德文。

680
00:29:19.790 --> 00:29:27.510
And the final baby at nine minutes, 17 seconds, that is Avery Farrell, the daughter of our writer, Anthony Farrell.
最后一个婴儿在九分十七秒，那是艾弗里·法瑞尔，我们编剧安东尼·法瑞尔的女儿。

681
00:29:27.710 --> 00:29:32.050
The woman was a background performer, but that's Anthony loading the stroller into the car.
那位女士是背景演员，但那是安东尼在把婴儿车装进车里。

682
00:29:32.050 --> 00:29:37.410
So we had had kind of like a little mini baby boom on our set.
所以我们片场当时经历了一场小型的婴儿潮。

683
00:29:37.670 --> 00:29:40.090
All of these kids were around the same age.
所有这些孩子年龄都差不多。

684
00:29:40.270 --> 00:29:41.290
I texted with Dean.
我给迪恩发了短信。

685
00:29:41.290 --> 00:29:46.130
He said his daughter, Emma, is now 13 years old.
他说他的女儿艾玛现在已经13岁了。

686
00:29:46.250 --> 00:29:49.950
And she tells everybody that she's one of the babies on the office.
她告诉所有人她是《办公室》里的婴儿之一。

687
00:29:50.470 --> 00:29:55.990
And Angela, I know you get asked a lot about Isabel because she was right around the same age, too.
安吉拉，我知道你经常被问到伊莎贝尔，因为她当时年龄也差不多。

688
00:29:56.570 --> 00:29:56.810
Yes.
是的。

689
00:29:57.030 --> 00:29:58.530
Isabel just had her 13th birthday.
伊莎贝尔刚过了13岁生日。

690
00:29:58.730 --> 00:30:00.110
There was this baby boom.
当时确实有一场婴儿潮。

691
00:30:00.110 --> 00:30:02.890
And it was really fun for us to have our babies on set.
能让我们的孩子出现在片场对我们来说真的很有趣。

692
00:30:03.030 --> 00:30:04.890
And I get asked if she was in this episode.
我经常被问到她是否出现在这一集里。

693
00:30:04.930 --> 00:30:05.650
And she wasn't.
她没有。

694
00:30:05.750 --> 00:30:06.590
And you know why?
你知道为什么吗？

695
00:30:06.850 --> 00:30:10.170
The day they filmed the scene with all the babies was my day off.
拍摄所有婴儿场景的那天正好是我休息的日子。

696
00:30:10.370 --> 00:30:10.770
Oh.
哦。

697
00:30:10.910 --> 00:30:14.650
And I wanted to be home with my baby, not bringing my baby to work.
我想待在家里陪我的孩子，而不是把她带到工作场所。

698
00:30:15.230 --> 00:30:16.630
So I wasn't in it.
所以我没参与拍摄。

699
00:30:16.730 --> 00:30:17.990
And they said, don't worry, Angela.
他们说，别担心，安吉拉。

700
00:30:18.150 --> 00:30:19.350
We're going to get Isabel in there.
我们会让伊莎贝尔出镜的。

701
00:30:19.350 --> 00:30:20.310
And they did.
他们确实这么做了。

702
00:30:20.610 --> 00:30:25.130
She ended up having a very fun day on set years later at Cece's dance recital.
多年后，她在西西的舞蹈表演片场度过了非常愉快的一天。

703
00:30:25.430 --> 00:30:26.090
I can't wait.
我等不及了。

704
00:30:26.370 --> 00:30:26.790
I know.
我知道。

705
00:30:27.250 --> 00:30:30.010
Well, Michael's going to try to make the best of it, OK?
好吧，迈克尔会尽量把事情处理好，好吗？

706
00:30:30.050 --> 00:30:33.150
He is going to present Astrid to the office.
他打算把阿斯特丽德带到办公室来。

707
00:30:33.150 --> 00:30:35.310
And they're going to go into the conference room.
然后他们会去会议室。

708
00:30:35.530 --> 00:30:39.670
Jenna, he does the Lion King and holds the car seat over his head.
珍娜，他模仿《狮子王》把婴儿提篮举过头顶。

709
00:30:39.850 --> 00:30:40.270
I know.
我知道。

710
00:30:40.350 --> 00:30:41.990
I hope that was fake baby day.
我希望那是假婴儿日。

711
00:30:42.190 --> 00:30:43.130
That was fake baby.
那是假婴儿。

712
00:30:43.170 --> 00:30:44.510
And that was all scripted.
而且那都是写好的剧本。

713
00:30:44.830 --> 00:30:45.610
Oh, boy.
天哪。

714
00:30:46.190 --> 00:30:52.110
Well, when we move into the conference room, Kevin is like, you know, the fact that the
嗯，当我们进入会议室时，凯文觉得，你知道，婴儿在这里

715
00:30:52.110 --> 00:30:54.490
baby's here kind of ruins the games.
有点破坏了游戏气氛。

716
00:30:55.410 --> 00:30:57.270
And Michael is like, no, it doesn't.
迈克尔却说，不，并没有。

717
00:30:57.350 --> 00:30:58.030
No, it doesn't.
不，并没有。

718
00:30:58.510 --> 00:30:59.630
It kind of did.
其实确实破坏了。

719
00:31:00.630 --> 00:31:05.150
Well, you know, the theme is a baby shower and all the games are for an expecting mother.
嗯，你知道，主题是迎婴派对，所有的游戏都是为准妈妈准备的。

720
00:31:05.150 --> 00:31:07.090
So it was really awkward.
所以当时真的很尴尬。

721
00:31:07.210 --> 00:31:12.010
But there are a lot of scenes in this conference room baby shower that didn't make it.
但是在这个会议室迎婴派对的场景里，有很多片段没能播出。

722
00:31:12.150 --> 00:31:13.050
I'm going to share a few.
我要分享几个。

723
00:31:13.350 --> 00:31:18.730
The first one is, Jenna, one of the funniest things I have had to witness, and we could not
第一个，珍娜，这是我见过的最有趣的事情之一，我们当时根本

724
00:31:18.730 --> 00:31:19.430
get through it.
演不下去。

725
00:31:19.710 --> 00:31:22.230
Kevin thinks he might be the sperm donor.
凯文以为他可能是精子捐赠者。

726
00:31:22.430 --> 00:31:24.770
And the look on Jan's face is amazing.
简脸上的表情太绝了。

727
00:31:25.010 --> 00:31:27.070
Sam, can you play that from the deleted scenes?
萨姆，你能播放一下删减片段里的那段吗？

728
00:31:28.050 --> 00:31:30.310
Hey, Jan, you went to a sperm bank?
嘿，简，你去过精子库吗？

729
00:31:30.590 --> 00:31:31.870
Yes, I did.
是的，我去过。

730
00:31:32.070 --> 00:31:33.210
I donated sperm.
我捐过精子。

731
00:31:33.210 --> 00:31:38.150
Oh, maybe I'm the father.
哦，也许我是孩子的父亲。

732
00:31:39.250 --> 00:31:42.010
Well, this is a highly exclusive establishment.
嗯，这是一家非常高端的机构。

733
00:31:42.350 --> 00:31:43.370
Next to the IHOP?
就在国际煎饼屋（IHOP）隔壁？

734
00:31:46.340 --> 00:31:48.040
Well, I paid for an ideal specimen.
嗯，我花钱买的是理想的样本。

735
00:31:48.520 --> 00:31:50.820
Are you saying Kevin is not an ideal specimen?
你是说凯文不是理想样本吗？

736
00:31:52.200 --> 00:31:54.460
This is a wonderful shower, everyone.
这是一个很棒的派对，各位。

737
00:31:54.880 --> 00:31:55.300
Thank you.
谢谢。

738
00:31:55.820 --> 00:31:57.940
I might have done it with Jan.
我可能和简发生过关系。

739
00:31:58.980 --> 00:31:59.840
It's not Kevin.
那不是凯文。

740
00:32:00.040 --> 00:32:05.050
I could not get through it.
我当时真的演不下去。

741
00:32:05.230 --> 00:32:08.790
Whenever Brian said, you mean the one by IHOP?
每当布莱恩说“你是说IHOP隔壁那家吗？”的时候。

742
00:32:08.790 --> 00:32:14.750
Just every single time, because Melora's reaction as Jan was so good.
每一次都笑场，因为梅洛拉饰演的简反应太到位了。

743
00:32:15.230 --> 00:32:20.910
And then, you know, she says she paid for premium sperm, which we learned might have been
然后，你知道，她说她花钱买了优质精子，我们后来了解到那可能是

744
00:32:20.910 --> 00:32:22.130
Andy Roddick's.
安迪·罗迪克的。

745
00:32:22.230 --> 00:32:28.910
I love there are so many deleted scenes about who the father of Jan's baby is.
我喜欢关于简的孩子父亲是谁的那些删减片段，真的太多了。

746
00:32:28.910 --> 00:32:31.630
We've got Andy Roddick, maybe Kevin.
我们有安迪·罗迪克，可能还有凯文。

747
00:32:32.010 --> 00:32:34.850
There's a lot of speculation that it's Hunter.
还有很多猜测说是亨特。

748
00:32:35.270 --> 00:32:35.830
Yes.
是的。

749
00:32:36.270 --> 00:32:40.250
And none of these scenes actually made it into the episodes.
而这些场景最终都没有出现在正片里。

750
00:32:40.550 --> 00:32:42.610
So what do you think about that?
那么你对此怎么看？

751
00:32:42.770 --> 00:32:46.250
Do you think, like, if something didn't make it in, it counts?
你觉得，如果有些内容没播出来，那还算数吗？

752
00:32:46.250 --> 00:32:49.670
Or does it not count if it doesn't make it in the episode?
或者说，如果没在剧集里播出来，就不算数了？

753
00:32:51.110 --> 00:32:51.750
So, yeah.
所以，没错。

754
00:32:51.870 --> 00:32:53.410
What is the canon, right?
到底什么是正史，对吧？

755
00:32:53.550 --> 00:32:54.270
Yes, exactly.
没错，正是如此。

756
00:32:54.270 --> 00:32:55.270
What is the canon of the show?
这部剧的正史到底是什么？

757
00:32:55.590 --> 00:32:58.790
Well, I guess it would have to be what aired, right?
嗯，我想应该是指播出的内容吧？

758
00:32:59.030 --> 00:33:01.490
So then that would mean it's just a mystery.
那也就意味着这只是个谜。

759
00:33:01.650 --> 00:33:02.310
It's a mystery.
这确实是个谜。

760
00:33:02.490 --> 00:33:04.330
She paid top dollar for it, though.
不过她可是花了大价钱买的。

761
00:33:04.450 --> 00:33:05.350
That's what we know.
这就是我们所知道的。

762
00:33:05.470 --> 00:33:05.690
Yeah.
是啊。

763
00:33:05.830 --> 00:33:08.770
That's all we know and all we'll ever truly know.
这就是我们所知道的一切，也是我们唯一能确定的事实。

764
00:33:09.290 --> 00:33:13.530
And I think the one thing we also know is that it's not Michael's because he had to
而且我觉得我们唯一能确定的是，那孩子不是迈克尔的，因为他不得不

765
00:33:13.530 --> 00:33:14.550
wear two condoMs.
戴两个避孕套。

766
