我是说，唱那么多歌肯定会让你精疲力竭的。

1069
00:48:27.440 --> 00:48:27.640
Yeah.
是啊。

1070
00:48:27.800 --> 00:48:29.000
She wants to take a nap.
她想小睡一会儿。

1071
00:48:29.260 --> 00:48:30.880
She gives the baby to Michael.
她把孩子交给了迈克尔。

1072
00:48:31.440 --> 00:48:36.920
And she says, when I wake up, I want to talk to you about Astrid's 529, which I looked
她说，等我醒来，我想和你谈谈阿斯特丽德的529计划，我查过了，

1073
00:48:36.920 --> 00:48:37.080
up.
它就是一种大学储蓄计划。

1074
00:48:37.160 --> 00:48:39.140
It's like a savings plan for college.
没错。

1075
00:48:39.420 --> 00:48:39.600
Yeah.
所以迈克尔必须参加所有的产前辅导班，但他却不能在

1076
00:48:39.600 --> 00:48:43.380
So what, Michael has to go to all the birthing classes, but he doesn't get to be there for
孩子出生时在场？

1077
00:48:43.380 --> 00:48:44.180
the birth of the baby?
现在他还要为大学基金出钱？

1078
00:48:44.260 --> 00:48:46.420
And now he's going to contribute to the college fund?
听起来就是这样。

1079
00:48:46.520 --> 00:48:47.640
That's what it sounds like.
简该走人了。

1080
00:48:47.800 --> 00:48:49.300
Jan needs to go buh-bye.
我同意。

1081
00:48:49.640 --> 00:48:50.280
I agree.
嗯，迈克尔只抱了一会儿孩子。

1082
00:48:50.700 --> 00:48:53.740
Well, Michael only holds the baby for a short time.
他没感觉到那种连接感。

1083
00:48:53.900 --> 00:48:55.900
He's not feeling that connection.
于是他把孩子交给了菲利斯。

1084
00:48:55.940 --> 00:48:57.900
And he gives the baby to Phyllis.
是啊。

1085
00:48:58.160 --> 00:48:58.400
Yeah.
首先，迈克尔得去仓库。

1086
00:48:58.400 --> 00:49:00.520
First, Michael has to go to the warehouse.
他需要达里尔给他一些建议。

1087
00:49:00.940 --> 00:49:03.020
He needs some advice from Daryl.
我们收到了粉丝伊森·B的一个问题。

1088
00:49:03.760 --> 00:49:06.700
We had a fan question from Ethan B.
史蒂夫问能不能抱达里尔的那一刻是即兴发挥的吗？

1089
00:49:07.100 --> 00:49:10.780
Did Steve improvise the moment when he asks if he can
他们演了这么一段，达里尔问他，你想抱这个吗？

1090
00:49:10.780 --> 00:49:11.620
hold Daryl?
你想抱那个吗？

1091
00:49:12.600 --> 00:49:17.040
They get on this runner where Daryl's like, do you want to hold this?
看看你有没有那种连接感。

1092
00:49:17.260 --> 00:49:18.180
Do you want to hold that?
你想抱我吗？

1093
00:49:18.320 --> 00:49:19.320
And see if you have a connection.
不，伙计们，那是剧本里写的。

1094
00:49:19.500 --> 00:49:20.520
Do you want to hold me?
整场戏都是照着剧本演的。

1095
00:49:21.080 --> 00:49:22.860
No, you guys, that was in the script.
嗯，在删减片段里，简还在睡觉。

1096
00:49:23.520 --> 00:49:26.080
That whole scene was scripted just like that.
她打着呼噜，大家都在看着她。

1097
00:49:26.080 --> 00:49:29.060
Well, Jan is still sleeping in the deleted scenes.
她用派对上的塑料桌布把自己盖住了。

1098
00:49:29.220 --> 00:49:31.880
She's like snoring and everyone's looking at her.
然后她醒了过来，和霍莉有了一段相当精彩的对话。

1099
00:49:32.040 --> 00:49:35.160
She's covered herself with a plastic tablecloth from the shower.
她用一张塑料浴帘把自己裹了起来。

1100
00:49:36.060 --> 00:49:40.180
And she wakes up and has a pretty amazing exchange with Holly.
然后她醒了过来，和霍莉进行了一次相当精彩的对话。

1101
00:49:40.420 --> 00:49:45.760
Where she realizes what we have realized, which is that Holly has a little bit of Michael
她意识到我们已经意识到的事情，那就是霍莉身上有一点迈克尔

1102
00:49:45.760 --> 00:49:46.480
Scott in her.
斯科特的影子。

1103
00:49:46.740 --> 00:49:47.100
Yeah.
没错。

1104
00:49:47.260 --> 00:49:49.400
She's making some real Michael Scott jokes here.
她在这里开了几个迈克尔·斯科特式的玩笑。

1105
00:49:49.560 --> 00:49:49.880
Yeah.
是啊。

1106
00:49:50.020 --> 00:49:51.820
And Jan is like, oh, I get it.
而简心想，哦，我明白了。

1107
00:49:51.960 --> 00:49:52.360
Funny.
真有趣。

1108
00:49:54.460 --> 00:49:57.740
But Astrid is now with Angela and Andy.
但阿斯特丽德现在和安吉拉与安迪在一起。

1109
00:49:57.900 --> 00:49:59.100
I love the scene so much.
我太喜欢这一幕了。

1110
00:49:59.280 --> 00:50:03.680
Angela, please tell me everything about putting all these vegetables on this baby.
安吉拉，请告诉我把所有这些蔬菜放在这个婴儿身上是怎么回事。

1111
00:50:03.960 --> 00:50:04.380
All right.
好的。

1112
00:50:04.580 --> 00:50:06.920
They had the table completely laid out.
他们把桌子完全布置好了。

1113
00:50:07.080 --> 00:50:08.800
They had it all staged.
他们把一切都准备就绪了。

1114
00:50:09.020 --> 00:50:12.160
They had the mom with the baby in the wings standing right there.
他们让妈妈带着婴儿在侧幕候场，就站在那儿。

1115
00:50:12.380 --> 00:50:15.860
And literally right before action, the mom put the baby down.
就在开拍前一刻，妈妈把婴儿放下了。

1116
00:50:16.220 --> 00:50:21.180
And then I just put that big, giant, fake piece of lettuce on the baby.
然后我就把那片巨大、虚假的生菜叶放在了婴儿身上。

1117
00:50:21.460 --> 00:50:23.760
It was really hard for me because I was a new mom.
这对我来说真的很难，因为我当时是一位新手妈妈。

1118
00:50:23.840 --> 00:50:26.680
And I just was like, okay, I just want to do this so faSt.
我当时就想，好吧，我只想快点完成这件事。

1119
00:50:26.780 --> 00:50:27.980
I want to do the scene so quickly.
我想尽快拍完这一幕。

1120
00:50:28.320 --> 00:50:32.840
And then it was so hard for me as a mom to not really connect with the baby at all and
作为一名母亲，不去真正地和婴儿建立任何联系，而只是说，

1121
00:50:32.840 --> 00:50:34.480
just say like, I need it to look up here.
我需要它往这儿看，这对我来说太难了。

1122
00:50:34.680 --> 00:50:35.600
Make it look up here.
让它往这儿看。

1123
00:50:35.720 --> 00:50:36.080
Yes.
是的。

1124
00:50:36.080 --> 00:50:37.940
But it's such a window into Angela.
但这真是了解安吉拉的一个窗口。

1125
00:50:38.240 --> 00:50:39.600
You know, she was a pageant baby.
你知道，她小时候就是个选美宝贝。

1126
00:50:39.600 --> 00:50:41.360
She dresses up her cats.
她会给她的猫打扮。

1127
00:50:41.580 --> 00:50:41.880
Yes.
没错。

1128
00:50:42.080 --> 00:50:46.360
I feel like her kids are going to be dressed up a lot for all kinds of photos.
我觉得她的孩子们以后肯定会为了各种照片被精心打扮。

1129
00:50:46.360 --> 00:50:47.940
And Andy is on board.
而且安迪也完全赞同。

1130
00:50:48.240 --> 00:50:56.060
I always imagined that Angela dressed Philip in like the little knee socks and shorts and
我一直想象安吉拉给菲利普穿那种小长筒袜、短裤和

1131
00:50:56.060 --> 00:51:00.660
suspenders with the little Peter Pan collar that you always see little Prince George wearing.
背带裤，配上那种你总能看到乔治小王子穿的彼得潘领衬衫。

1132
00:51:01.200 --> 00:51:03.180
That's how I imagined Philip dresses.
我就是这样想象菲利普的穿着的。

1133
00:51:03.180 --> 00:51:04.120
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

1134
00:51:04.340 --> 00:51:08.140
And I also imagined that Angela had like a little sailor suit for him.
而且我还想象安吉拉给他准备了一套小水手服。

1135
00:51:08.280 --> 00:51:08.600
For sure.
肯定的。

1136
00:51:08.880 --> 00:51:09.420
With a sailor hat.
还要配上一顶水手帽。

1137
00:51:09.620 --> 00:51:10.420
A hundred percent.
百分之百。

1138
00:51:10.680 --> 00:51:11.360
All of that.
全套都要。

1139
00:51:11.540 --> 00:51:11.780
Yes.
是的。

1140
00:51:12.100 --> 00:51:18.140
Jan comes in as Andy and Angela are having their Ann Geddes moment, creating this baby salad
当安迪和安吉拉正在享受他们的安·格迪斯时刻，创作这个婴儿沙拉

1141
00:51:18.140 --> 00:51:18.540
photo.
照片时，简进来了。

1142
00:51:18.640 --> 00:51:21.520
And she is not happy.
她很不高兴。

1143
00:51:21.760 --> 00:51:22.940
No, she's irritated.
不，她很恼火。

1144
00:51:23.220 --> 00:51:24.800
And she wants to go.
她想走了。

1145
00:51:24.980 --> 00:51:25.760
She's done.
她受够了。

1146
00:51:25.920 --> 00:51:26.520
She's done.
她不想再待下去了。

1147
00:51:26.720 --> 00:51:28.500
She finds Michael in the kitchen.
她在厨房找到了迈克尔。

1148
00:51:28.940 --> 00:51:30.660
And she's ready to go.
她准备走了。

1149
00:51:30.660 --> 00:51:33.580
So, and Michael insults Holly again.
所以，迈克尔又一次侮辱了霍莉。

1150
00:51:33.780 --> 00:51:38.260
I guess we've failed to mention that throughout this whole episode, every time Michael, Holly,
我想我们还没提到，在这一整集中，每次迈克尔、霍莉，

1151
00:51:38.400 --> 00:51:42.620
and Jan are together, Michael just keeps, you know, insulting her.
还有简在一起的时候，迈克尔总是，你知道的，羞辱她。

1152
00:51:42.760 --> 00:51:46.540
When Holly was going to go into the conference room, he's like, ugh, HR.
当霍莉要进会议室时，他说，呃，人力资源部。

1153
00:51:46.780 --> 00:51:48.920
Now he says she smells like rotten tomatoes.
现在他说她闻起来像烂番茄。

1154
00:51:49.240 --> 00:51:49.900
And dirt.
还有泥土。

1155
00:51:50.340 --> 00:51:51.040
And dirt.
还有泥土。

1156
00:51:51.260 --> 00:51:52.880
She smells like tomatoes and dirt.
她闻起来像番茄和泥土。

1157
00:51:53.200 --> 00:51:53.580
Yeah.
是啊。

1158
00:51:54.060 --> 00:51:55.100
And you know what?
而且你知道吗？

1159
00:51:55.200 --> 00:51:56.460
Jan sees all of it.
简把这一切都看在眼里。

1160
00:51:56.800 --> 00:51:58.220
Jan knows what Michael's doing.
简知道迈克尔在做什么。

1161
00:51:58.980 --> 00:52:00.920
And he walks her out to the car.
他送她走到车边。

1162
00:52:01.460 --> 00:52:03.820
And as she's putting the baby in the car seat, she turns around.
当她把孩子放进安全座椅时，她转过身来。

1163
00:52:03.920 --> 00:52:05.700
She's like, there is one more thing you could do for me.
她说，你还能为我做最后一件事。

1164
00:52:06.120 --> 00:52:07.040
And he's like, what?
他问，什么事？

1165
00:52:07.220 --> 00:52:09.360
And she says, don't date Holly.
她说，别和霍莉约会。

1166
00:52:09.800 --> 00:52:10.140
Yeah.
是啊。

1167
00:52:10.400 --> 00:52:12.260
And he's like, why would I hate her?
他说，我为什么要讨厌她？

1168
00:52:12.360 --> 00:52:13.280
Why would I, ugh?
我为什么要，呃？

1169
00:52:13.480 --> 00:52:13.820
You know?
你知道吗？

1170
00:52:13.960 --> 00:52:15.640
And he clearly likes her.
而且他显然喜欢她。

1171
00:52:16.340 --> 00:52:16.540
Yeah.
是啊。

1172
00:52:17.320 --> 00:52:18.060
Jan leaves.
简离开了。

1173
00:52:18.320 --> 00:52:20.800
She leaves the stroller that was gifted to her.
她留下了别人送给她的婴儿车。

1174
00:52:23.580 --> 00:52:24.620
So tacky.
真俗气。

1175
00:52:24.780 --> 00:52:25.460
Tacky Jan.
俗气的简。

1176
00:52:25.840 --> 00:52:28.000
What was the point of the baby shower?
那场迎婴派对的意义何在？

1177
00:52:28.340 --> 00:52:32.560
That she could get a nap and maybe get some money out of Michael for a college fund.
为了让她能小睡一会儿，或许还能从迈克尔那儿弄点钱存进大学基金。

1178
00:52:32.680 --> 00:52:33.600
That's what it was.
就是为了这个。

1179
00:52:33.740 --> 00:52:34.000
Yeah.
是啊。

1180
00:52:34.400 --> 00:52:36.100
Well, Michael is going to go upstairs.
好吧，迈克尔要上楼了。

1181
00:52:36.520 --> 00:52:41.960
And he finds Holly and she says, are you going to still be mean to me?
他找到了霍莉，她说，你还会对我刻薄吗？

1182
00:52:42.440 --> 00:52:44.200
And he just gives her a hug.
他只是给了她一个拥抱。

1183
00:52:44.360 --> 00:52:47.360
It's the warmest, most intimate hug.
那是极其温暖、极其亲密的拥抱。

1184
00:52:47.760 --> 00:52:48.980
It's so intimate.
太亲密了。

1185
00:52:49.520 --> 00:52:51.040
Amy Ryan is so great.
艾米·瑞恩演得真好。

1186
00:52:51.280 --> 00:52:53.160
Her eyes just fill with tears.
她的眼里瞬间盈满了泪水。

1187
00:52:53.580 --> 00:52:59.780
And then Michael has this talking head where he says he didn't feel much when he held Astrid,
然后迈克尔有个采访镜头，他说他抱阿斯特丽德时没太多感觉，

1188
00:53:00.500 --> 00:53:04.520
but he got a good feeling when he held Holly.
但抱霍莉时感觉很好。

1189
00:53:04.940 --> 00:53:06.580
He asked her out on a date.
他约她出去约会。

1190
00:53:06.740 --> 00:53:07.060
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1191
00:53:07.240 --> 00:53:09.280
A real official date.
一次正式的约会。

1192
00:53:09.480 --> 00:53:10.680
And she says yes.
她答应了。

1193
00:53:10.980 --> 00:53:12.000
She sure does.
她确实答应了。

1194
00:53:12.400 --> 00:53:15.100
So we're ending with a little love connection there.
所以我们以一段小小的爱情火花作为结尾。

1195
00:53:15.800 --> 00:53:21.340
But now Jim and Pam are both trying to call each other at the same time and they miss each other.
但现在吉姆和帕姆都在同时给对方打电话，结果都错过了。

1196
00:53:21.340 --> 00:53:23.660
They both go to voicemail at the same time.
他们同时转进了语音信箱。

1197
00:53:23.840 --> 00:53:27.240
And I remember Greg talking to me about this scene.
我记得格雷格跟我讨论过这个场景。

1198
00:53:27.460 --> 00:53:35.780
I just loved this idea that we're going to hear each side of their voicemail message and you're going to see they really are connected.
我特别喜欢这个点子，我们能听到他们各自的语音留言，你会发现他们确实心有灵犀。

1199
00:53:35.780 --> 00:53:45.800
They both recall this same story about the time that, you know, some man came into the laundromat and Jim had to save Pam and then they bought a washer dryer.
他们都回忆起同一件事，就是那个男人走进自助洗衣店，吉姆不得不救帕姆，然后他们买了洗衣机和烘干机。

1200
00:53:46.060 --> 00:53:47.920
They're recalling this same event.
他们在回忆同一件事。

1201
00:53:47.920 --> 00:53:52.380
And at the end, they both say, I guess this was just one of those days.
最后他们俩都说，我想这只是倒霉的一天。

1202
00:53:52.400 --> 00:53:53.380
I miss you.
我想你。

1203
00:53:53.520 --> 00:53:54.400
I wish you were home.
真希望你在家。

1204
00:53:55.380 --> 00:54:03.000
Aaron shared with me that he was just so curious how this scene would turn out because you guys filmed it in two different locations.
亚伦跟我说，他特别好奇这场戏最后会呈现出什么效果，因为你们是在两个不同的地点拍摄的。

1205
00:54:03.620 --> 00:54:05.840
You didn't have the other person there.
你当时身边没有对方。

1206
00:54:06.120 --> 00:54:07.280
No, I couldn't hear John.
没错，我听不到约翰的声音。

1207
00:54:07.280 --> 00:54:09.180
It was like I was really leaving a message.
感觉就像我真的在留言一样。

1208
00:54:09.380 --> 00:54:09.660
Yeah.
是啊。

1209
00:54:09.660 --> 00:54:16.340
And so you guys were just in this vacuum separate and then in editing, they were going to find the moment and create it.
所以你们当时就像是在真空里各自表演，然后后期剪辑时，他们再寻找契合点把戏拼在一起。

1210
00:54:16.480 --> 00:54:21.160
And he just sort of marveled at how the whole thing came together and just so perfectly.
他当时就感叹整场戏最后呈现得如此完美。

1211
00:54:21.660 --> 00:54:21.880
Yes.
是的。

1212
00:54:22.080 --> 00:54:26.620
Well, I had to really imagine in my head as an actor that I was just leaving a message.
嗯，作为演员，我必须在脑海中想象自己真的只是在留言。

1213
00:54:26.620 --> 00:54:31.400
So in the script, I could see how our dialogue was going to alternate and sync up.
剧本里我能看到我们的对话是如何交替和同步的。

1214
00:54:31.400 --> 00:54:40.000
But I put that out of my mind and I just did my half without thinking of John's lines in my head at all.
但我把这些抛在脑后，完全不去想约翰的台词，只演好我自己的那部分。

1215
00:54:40.140 --> 00:54:40.340
Right.
没错。

1216
00:54:40.340 --> 00:54:41.920
And we filmed it like a monologue.
我们把它当成独白来拍的。

1217
00:54:42.540 --> 00:54:42.760
Yeah.
是啊。

1218
00:54:42.920 --> 00:54:43.820
Well, I loved it.
我很喜欢。

1219
00:54:43.940 --> 00:54:45.160
I thought it was really sweet.
我觉得这真的很温馨。

1220
00:54:45.160 --> 00:54:49.960
And it also made me a little sad because you can tell the distance is starting to take a toll.
但也让我有点难过，因为你能感觉到距离感开始造成影响了。

1221
00:54:50.340 --> 00:54:50.560
Yeah.
是啊。

1222
00:54:51.160 --> 00:54:52.780
Well, that ends the episode.
好了，这一集到此结束。

1223
00:54:53.240 --> 00:54:56.240
But, Angela, I just realized I skipped a fan question.
但是，安吉拉，我刚意识到我漏掉了一个粉丝提问。

1224
00:54:56.480 --> 00:54:56.780
Okay.
好的。

1225
00:54:57.020 --> 00:54:59.000
And I don't want to leave Evan L.
我不想让埃文·L。

1226
00:54:59.360 --> 00:54:59.410
hanging.
空等。

1227
00:54:59.680 --> 00:55:00.360
Okay, Evan.
好的，埃文。

1228
00:55:00.940 --> 00:55:10.660
Evan wrote in to say at 17 minutes, 30 seconds, was that really rain driving around with the stroller tied to the back of the car or was that a stunt driver?
埃文写信问，在17分30秒的时候，那是真的在下雨吗？开车时后面拖着婴儿车，那是特技车手开的吗？

1229
00:55:11.160 --> 00:55:13.060
Well, we had a stunt driver.
嗯，我们确实有特技车手。

1230
00:55:13.280 --> 00:55:15.500
His name was Sean Crowder.
他叫肖恩·克劳德。

1231
00:55:15.960 --> 00:55:19.040
We also had a stunt coordinator named Wally Crowder.
我们还有一位特技协调员叫沃利·克劳德。

1232
00:55:19.340 --> 00:55:22.380
And so Sean did the driving parts.
所以驾驶的部分都是肖恩完成的。

1233
00:55:22.720 --> 00:55:28.040
Now, you know, there were some shots of rain inside the car, but the other stuff, that was a stunt driver?
我知道车内拍摄的雨景镜头是我们自己拍的，但其他部分是特技车手开的？

1234
00:55:28.380 --> 00:55:28.860
Yes.
是的。

1235
00:55:28.860 --> 00:55:32.600
We would often do the driving that was just sort of like where you pull up and stop.
我们通常会自己拍一些简单的驾驶镜头，比如那种开过来停下的画面。

1236
00:55:32.880 --> 00:55:33.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1237
00:55:33.320 --> 00:55:37.340
But then if there was like aggressive driving, that's when the stunt driver would take over.
但如果有那种激烈的驾驶动作，就会由特技车手接手。

1238
00:55:37.520 --> 00:55:37.740
Yes.
没错。

1239
00:55:37.980 --> 00:55:39.360
Well, I loved this episode.
我很喜欢这一集。

1240
00:55:39.360 --> 00:55:43.140
I thought it was so good and layered with so much heartfelt stuff.
我觉得它非常棒，而且蕴含了许多真挚的情感。

1241
00:55:43.540 --> 00:55:47.300
And before we say goodbye, I have a little bit of trivia for you.
在告别之前，我有个小知识要告诉你。

1242
00:55:47.560 --> 00:55:47.820
Okay.
好啊。

1243
00:55:47.820 --> 00:55:54.920
According to babycenter.com, here are the top girl and boy names in 2008.
根据babycenter.com的数据，这是2008年最受欢迎的女孩和男孩名字。

1244
00:55:55.300 --> 00:55:57.040
Oh, from when we did this episode.
哦，就是我们拍这一集的时候。

1245
00:55:57.180 --> 00:55:57.720
That's right.
没错。

1246
00:55:58.100 --> 00:55:59.440
Any guesses for the girl?
猜猜女孩的名字是什么？

1247
00:56:00.800 --> 00:56:01.440
Emma.
艾玛。

1248
00:56:01.840 --> 00:56:02.340
Yes.
没错。

1249
00:56:02.420 --> 00:56:02.760
Ah!
啊！

1250
00:56:03.000 --> 00:56:03.840
You got it!
你猜对了！

1251
00:56:04.040 --> 00:56:06.260
I was thinking maybe because of the friend's baby.
我在想可能是因为朋友的孩子。

1252
00:56:06.580 --> 00:56:07.040
Yes.
是的。

1253
00:56:07.260 --> 00:56:08.260
Rachel had Emma.
瑞秋生了艾玛。

1254
00:56:08.600 --> 00:56:09.940
Really put that name on the map.
真是让这个名字火了起来。

1255
00:56:10.400 --> 00:56:11.860
Guess what the boy name was.
猜猜男孩的名字是什么。

1256
00:56:12.380 --> 00:56:16.720
I guessed Emma for the girl, like you, but I did not guess right for the boy name.
我猜女孩叫艾玛，和你一样，但我没猜对男孩的名字。

1257
00:56:17.680 --> 00:56:18.180
Liam.
利亚姆。

1258
00:56:19.000 --> 00:56:19.380
Aiden.
艾登。

1259
00:56:20.100 --> 00:56:20.600
Aiden.
艾登。

1260
00:56:21.080 --> 00:56:23.020
Aiden was the top boy name.
艾登是当时最热门的男孩名。

1261
00:56:23.020 --> 00:56:24.480
Was that from Sex and the City?
那是出自《欲望都市》吗？

1262
00:56:25.060 --> 00:56:25.920
I don't know.
我不知道。

1263
00:56:26.140 --> 00:56:27.080
I guessed Jack.
我猜的是杰克。

1264
00:56:27.340 --> 00:56:27.720
Okay.
好吧。

1265
00:56:27.900 --> 00:56:31.760
He was in the top five, but Aiden and Emma.
他排在前五名，但艾登和艾玛才是第一。

1266
00:56:32.420 --> 00:56:33.680
Well, there it is.
好吧，就是这样。

1267
00:56:33.780 --> 00:56:36.740
You've learned some new baby showers, the Sip and See.
你们又了解了一些新的迎婴派对形式，比如“啜饮与探视”。

1268
00:56:37.300 --> 00:56:39.340
M&Ms are still printing names.
M&M豆还在印名字呢。

1269
00:56:39.640 --> 00:56:42.280
Yeah, and the Orbit stroller's actually really good.
没错，而且Orbit婴儿车确实非常好用。

1270
00:56:42.540 --> 00:56:45.240
And Emma and Aiden, 2008 babies.
艾玛和艾登，2008年的宝宝们。

1271
00:56:45.240 --> 00:56:46.020
Where are you now?
你们现在在哪儿呢？

1272
00:56:46.220 --> 00:56:48.600
I would love it if an Emma and Aiden got married.
如果一个叫艾玛和一个叫艾登的孩子结婚了，我会觉得很棒。

1273
00:56:48.980 --> 00:56:49.500
Oh.
哦。

1274
00:56:50.300 --> 00:56:51.940
Well, that was Baby Shower.
好了，以上就是关于迎婴派对的内容。

1275
00:56:52.020 --> 00:56:53.120
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

1276
